{"name":"075 synth-c - the construct","date":"2005-02-19T02:01:32.000Z","clearFrame":false,"components":[{"type":"Comment","group":"Misc","text":"______________________________________\r\n|_______________                                             \\\r\n\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\ \\     Synth-C \\ Chris Blom        \\\r\n                                 \\     Pack 1  \\Lift Off               \\\r\n                                   \\    004/030\\ The Construct   \\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\                                         \\__________________________________\\ \r\n\r\nInspired by Constructor by El-Vis an the Mechanical Curvature presets by Jheriko.\r\n\r\nv1.1  Some tinkering with the scope, added fog to the DM, fixed most ugly edges by using cylindric instead of planar mapping, texture is only drawn on load and resize now\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\nYou may use any part of this preset under the condition that you include credits, contact information (synth_c@hotmail.com), and my site (www.synth-c.deviantart.com).\r\nYou may remix this preset without my permission if you include this comment in it and let me now where to get it.\r\n"},{"type":"EffectList","enabled":true,"clearFrame":true,"input":"IGNORE","output":"REPLACE","inAdjustBlend":128,"outAdjustBlend":128,"inBuffer":0,"outBuffer":0,"inBufferInvert":false,"outBufferInvert":false,"enableOnBeat":false,"enableOnBeatFor":1,"code":{"enabled":"true","init":"\u000e","perFrame":"w=w-1;ih=h-1"},"components":[{"type":"ClearScreen","group":"Render","enabled":true,"color":"#ffffff","blendMode":"REPLACE","onlyFirst":false},{"type":"Grain","group":"Trans","enabled":true,"blendMode":"FIFTY_FIFTY","amount":100,"static":true},{"type":"SuperScope","group":"Render","code":{"init":"n=20","perFrame":"linesize=w*.1","onBeat":"","perPoint":"x=i*2-1;y=1;\r\nbn=bnot(bn);\r\nred=bn/2+.25;\r\nblue=red;\r\ngreen=red"},"audioChannel":"CENTER","audioSource":"WAVEFORM","colors":["#c0c0c0"],"drawMode":"LINES"},{"type